.idea

# EPIC-XF-10-S03 (HRMS-040): the production secret file lives on the
# production host and never in version control. `.env.example` next to it is
# the committed contract and contains no secret.
infra/prod/.env
infra/prod/.env.*
!infra/prod/.env.example

# Database dumps taken by deploy.sh are the rollback position; they contain
# live tenant data and must not be committed if one is ever copied out of the
# volume for inspection.
*.sql.gz
infra/prod/backups/
